# Allow-list: the serving image needs only its requirements, the source
# package, and the trained artifact. Everything else (raw survey data --
# personal data that must not leak into an image -- notebooks, reports,
# virtualenvs, git history) is excluded from the build context.
*
!requirements-serving.txt
!src/fin_inclusion/__init__.py
!src/fin_inclusion/serving/
!src/fin_inclusion/monitoring/
!models/production/model.json
!models/production/metadata.json
!models/production/reference_profile.json
**/__pycache__
